徐夫人，吳郡富春人也。祖父真，與權父堅相親，堅以妹妻真，生琨。琨少仕州郡，漢末擾亂，去吏，隨堅征伐有功，拜偏將軍。堅薨，隨孫策討樊能、於糜等於橫江，擊張英於當利口。而船少，欲駐軍更求。琨母時在軍中，謂琨曰：「恐州家多發水軍來逆人，則不利矣，如何可駐邪？宜伐蘆葦以為泭，佐船渡軍。」琨具啟策，策即行之。眾悉俱濟，遂破英，擊走笮融、劉繇，事業克定。策表琨領丹楊太守，會吳景委廣陵來東，復為丹楊守。琨以督軍中郎將領兵，從破廬江太守李術，封廣德侯，遷平虜將軍。後從討黃祖，中流矢卒。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-xu:line026:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-xu:line026:m0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"徐夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"75m_kfd_6qo","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-xu:line026:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"真","kind":"person","person_id":"chi_c64_eif","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-xu:line026:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-xu:line026:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"堅","kind":"person","person_id":"ki7_rgz_3l4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-xu:line026:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"堅","kind":"person","person_id":"ki7_rgz_3l4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-xu:line026:m0027","surface":"妹","start":27,"end":28,"kind":"person","person_id":"igh_i1d_c5p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-xu:line026:m0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"真","kind":"person","person_id":"chi_c64_eif","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-xu:line026:m0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"chi_c64_eif_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-san